Ladybird preserves the six specified spellings of writing-mode,
and computes horizontal-tb or vertical-rl before resolving logical
sides. Blink maps the identifiers in CssValueIDToPlatformEnum()
for WritingMode. WebKit maps the legacy values declared in
CSSProperties.json, and Gecko accepts aliases on WritingModeProperty.

Chrome 157.0.8103.79 and WebKit 26.5 kept the legacy spelling in the
declaration. Firefox 151.0 serialized its modern equivalent. All three
computed the same writing modes, independently of direction.
